Wed Nov  4 22:55:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- Build on OBS: the cargo config for the vendored crates goes to the
  top of the sources, where cargo looks for it (it was in rs/, which
  cargo never reads with --manifest-path, so the offline build failed)

