Tue Nov  3 07:00:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- First package: herkosd as a system service (socket activation, system
  user herkos) and herkos-agent, the session agent with the
  confirmation window. Tools run as the person in template units
  (vilna-mcp-files@, vilna-mcp-backup@) that herkosd may only start
  (polkit rule).
